<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:modeler="http://camunda.org/schema/modeler/1.0" xmlns:camunda="http://camunda.org/schema/1.0/bpmn" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_masterRuleListPop" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn" exporter="bpmn-tool" exporterVersion="1.2.0" modeler:executionPlatform="Camunda Platform" modeler:executionPlatformVersion="7.15.0">
  <bpmn:process id="masterRuleListPop" name="업무기준 List조회" isExecutable="true">
    <bpmn:documentation>masterRuleListPop — As-Is mui cmb/MasterRuleListPop (분석 §1 / 기능 §1 / BPMN §1) 의 To-Be BPMN.

조회 전용 LoV 팝업 — 단일 action(search), 쓰기 트랜잭션 없음 (Java UserTask 부재 — As-Is CommonSelectTask 단독).

사용자 결정:
  - As-Is process id `MasterJudgRuleListPop` ↔ Form id `MasterRuleListPop` 불일치 → To-Be `masterRuleListPop` 통일 (분석 §0/§11)
  - DEC-03 영속성 = JPA — RuleMasterRepository.searchRuleMasterListPop (9 컬럼, 고정필터 RULE_ID != COALESCE(OLD_RULE_ID,' ') — masterRuleList 화면과 필터 상이, USE_TP 필터 없음)
  - Q-002 sSchema = As-Is 유지 + 화이트리스트 가드 (공란/MCAAPUSER/MCA_SOURCE 동의어 — Service 검증)

1 action 매핑:
  action=search → searchTask (masterRuleListPopService.search) — GetRuleMasterList (UPPER LIKE 2 + ORDER BY RULE_ID). 응답 { ds_GetRuleMasterList, cnt }</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:extensionElements>
      <camunda:properties>
        <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
      </camunda:properties>
    </bpmn:extensionElements>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="start">
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_to_gw</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="actionGateway">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_to_gw</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="searchTask" name="업무기준 목록 조회 (현행 필터 + 2 LIKE)" camunda:class="masterRuleListPopService">
      <bpmn:documentation>As-Is GetRuleMasterList (mui MasterRuleListPopMapper SELECT 1) 의 JPQL 변환 (분석 §6.1).
- RuleMasterRepository.searchRuleMasterListPop(pRuleId, pRuleNm) — RULE_ID != COALESCE(OLD_RULE_ID,' ') (BR-001) + UPPER 양변 LIKE 2 (BR-002/003) + ORDER BY RULE_ID (BR-004)
- sSchema 화이트리스트 가드 (Q-002 — INVALID_VALUE)
- 반환 = { ds_GetRuleMasterList: [9컬럼 camelCase rows], cnt } (As-Is resultKey 보존 — BPMN §2.2, MSG-001)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="search" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleListPop.dto.MasterRuleListPopSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endSearch">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_to_gw" sourceRef="start" targetRef="actionGateway" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search" name="search" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="searchTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search_end" sourceRef="searchTask" targetRef="endSearch" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="BPMNDiagram_1">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="BPMNPlane_1" bpmnElement="masterRuleListPop">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="start_di" bpmnElement="start">
        <dc:Bounds x="152" y="172" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="actionGateway_di" bpmnElement="actionGateway" isMarkerVisible="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="245" y="165" width="50" height="50" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="searchTask_di" bpmnElement="searchTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="370" y="150" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="endSearch_di" bpmnElement="endSearch">
        <dc:Bounds x="560" y="172" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_to_gw_di" bpmnElement="flow_to_gw">
        <di:waypoint x="188" y="190" />
        <di:waypoint x="245" y="190" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_search_di" bpmnElement="flow_search">
        <di:waypoint x="295" y="190" />
        <di:waypoint x="370" y="190" />
        <bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
          <dc:Bounds x="312.5" y="173" width="48" height="14" />
        </bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_search_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_search_end">
        <di:waypoint x="470" y="190" />
        <di:waypoint x="560" y="190" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>

